{
  "name": "URLs to markdown files in Drive with Gaffa",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Batch convert URLs to markdown files in Drive\n\n### How it works\nKeep a list of URLs in a Google Sheet. On a schedule, this workflow converts each page to clean markdown with Gaffa and saves it to Google Drive, then marks the row done so the next run skips it. A failed page is marked with an error and the run carries on.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the Gaffa community node (@gaffa-dev/n8n-nodes-gaffa) and add your Gaffa API key.\n2. Connect Google Sheets and Google Drive.\n3. Copy the sample sheet, add your URLs, pick your Drive folder, set the schedule, activate.\n\n### Customization tips\nSet a CSS selector in the Gaffa node to keep only the main content. Change the schedule to match how often you add URLs. Adjust the loop batch size to control pages per pass.",
        "height": 524,
        "width": 556,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -544,
        96
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Read and filter\nRun on a schedule, read the sheet, and keep only rows that have a URL and are not done yet.",
        "height": 124,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Section read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Loop and convert\nWork through the URLs one batch at a time. Gaffa loads each page in a real browser and returns clean markdown. On failure the row is marked error and the loop continues.",
        "height": 204,
        "width": 150,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Section convert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        352,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Save and mark done\nStrip leftover links and navigation, save the markdown as a file in Drive, then mark the sheet row done.",
        "height": 124,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Section save",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1632,
